          }
        ],
        "text": "In 1960 Congress declared the former Fort Apache military post to be held in trust for the White Mountain Apache Tribe."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court stated that only Congress, not the executive branch, has the power to terminate this reservation."
      }
    ],
