            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The oral argument began at 10:03 a.m. before the Supreme Court of the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice O'Connor asked whether the trust allows the Government to use the property for school or administrative needs and whether there is something more than in Mitchell I."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether the Government\u2019s initial argument was that the Government possessed the buildings after 1960."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 41,
              "start": 41
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked, \u201cAt its expense?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked whether the Government is responsible for waste or damage that occurred up to the point they ceased using the property or relinquished control."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "befe6510142eccd3b6e161301b2ae20ff2572538e610d9cd6d474169569f34c9",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-befe6510142e-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked whether the Government can terminate the trust at any time by executive order."
      }
    ],
